<FootnoteText>
<Para>
<Text>Section 11(2) of the Road Traffic Act 1988 provides that the term “controlled drug” has the meaning given by section 2 of the Misuse of Drugs Act <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/1971/38" id="c00004" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct" Year="1971" Number="0038">1971 (c.38)</Citation>. The definition in section 11(2) was inserted into the Road Traffic Act 1988 by section 56(2)(a) of the Crime and Courts Act 2013.</Text>
</Para>
</FootnoteText>
</Footnote></Footnotes></Legislation>